      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quest Energy was one of 3 quotes we obtained through the Solar Quotes process and we found Moe was very professional and knowledgeable. He was very mindful of our needs at our stage of life and was happy to quote on various combinations of panels and inverters to achieve a good balance of quality products and price. The system was installed by their own installers not subcontractors within one week of making our decision and we couldn’t fault the work of Michael and Cameron. We would highly recommend choosing Quest Energy to supply and install your solar PV system.",
