      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quest stood out from the first meeting in terms of professionalism, knowledge and preparedness/ability to discuss and explain all aspects with a non-technical purchaser. They were polite, patient and not at all pushy - and their installer thoroughly inspected the property prior to quotation in order to be accurate and to come up with a layout that best suited our needs.  This was extremely helpful and meant that we could arrange to have the TV aerial moved prior to installation day, as well ensuring that the panels were positioned with a view to other possible future renovations. We took our time to decide, and asked many (no doubt tortuous and detailed) questions.  Quest responded quickly and helpfully to all of these.  The installation was also impressively done, despite taking longer than planned and with some challenges due to bad weather, and the team took the time to make sure it was achieved very discreetly with the new switchboard and Enphase system placed neatly in an existing laundry cupboard and all wiring hidden.  All of the Quest team were a pleasure to deal with and completely reliable - I would have no hesitation in recommending them.",
